<section class="quote">
  <div class="container quote__inner" data-reveal>
    <div class="quote__avatar" aria-hidden="true">SA</div>

    <svg class="quote__mark" width="34" height="26" viewBox="0 0 34 26" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        d="M0 26 V13 C0 5.8 5 0.9 12.4 0 V6.4 C8.4 7.1 6.4 9.4 6.2 13.1 H12.4 V26 H0 Z M18.9 26 V13 C18.9 5.8 23.9 0.9 31.3 0 V6.4 C27.3 7.1 25.3 9.4 25.1 13.1 H31.3 V26 H18.9 Z"
        fill="var(--color-blue-pale)"
      />
    </svg>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        "What struck me about the CHIME solution was that 100% of the people involved in the
        selection process — real business people, not procurement folks, but operational people —
        said they could use it in their roles tomorrow. And 98% said it was an improvement on the
        current solution."
      </p>
      <footer>
        <cite>Suleman Alli</cite> — Director of Customer Service, Strategy, Regulation and
        Technology at UK Power Networks
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote {
    background: var(--color-grey-100);
  }

  .quote__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 47.5rem;
    padding-block: 6rem;
  }

  .quote__avatar {
    width: 5.5rem;
    height: 5.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-signal);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  blockquote cite {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
